  "html": "<!-- TODO (EJ): voice done. Still missing a shot of the actual MAP view — everything captured so far is the data UI. Draft until that lands. -->\n<p class=\"\">A dark, terminal-aesthetic map of publicly available ICE and immigration-enforcement facilities, where every source is graded with the NATO Admiralty code.</p>\n<p class=\"\">I didn't reach for the Admiralty code because this needed military-grade rigor. I reached for it because it's already how I think when I'm doing my own OSINT — reliability of the source on one axis, credibility of the information on the other — and it's a system built to carry exactly the ratings I care about. Borrowing it beats inventing a grading scheme, and it's dense: two characters tell you how much to trust a line.</p>\n<p class=\"\">It's also cosplay, and I'd rather say so than pretend otherwise. I like how it looks. The dark terminal, the alphanumeric confidence codes — they make the thing feel like an intelligence product, which is partly borrowed seriousness and partly just an aesthetic I enjoy.</p>\n<p class=\"\">A bit of cosplay and a bit of utilitarianism, mixed together.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Scrolling the live site — custody stat tiles, facility records, population charts, and the data-sources ledger\" class=\"\"><video class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/so_0,f_jpg,q_auto,w_1280/projects/mapping-ice/site-scroll.jpg\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/q_auto/projects/mapping-ice/site-scroll.mp4\" aria-label=\"Scrolling the live site — custody stat tiles, facility records, population charts, and the data-sources ledger\"></video><figcaption class=\"\">Scrolling the live site — custody stat tiles, facility records, population charts, and the data-sources ledger</figcaption></figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Detention Infrastructure overview — custody counts, spend, and new facilities\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/mapping-ice/overview.png\" alt=\"Detention Infrastructure overview — custody counts, spend, and new facilities\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/mapping-ice/overview.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/mapping-ice/overview.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/mapping-ice/overview.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/mapping-ice/overview.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Detention Infrastructure overview — custody counts, spend, and new facilities\" width=\"3200\" height=\"1600\" style=\"--splay-rot:2.4deg;\" data-dimensions=\"3200×1600\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Detention Infrastructure overview — custody counts, spend, and new facilities</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Facility records under development, with status tags\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/mapping-ice/facilities.png\" alt=\"Facility records under development, with status tags\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/mapping-ice/facilities.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/mapping-ice/facilities.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/mapping-ice/facilities.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/mapping-ice/facilities.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Facility records under development, with status tags\" width=\"3200\" height=\"1600\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.81deg;\" data-dimensions=\"3200×1600\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Facility records under development, with status tags</figcaption>\n</figure>",
